sources=[
 dated_source('src-pushingice-fountainhead-trade','Pushing Ice: the Fountainhead trade period','Wikipedia contributors','https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pushing_Ice','The colony coexists with Fountainheads for decades, receiving technology and rejuvenation in exchange for Janus drilling rights before evacuation.','One distinct period, not the early survival phase or the later restored colony; rejuvenation is not participation.',access='Indexed Fountainhead coexistence, trade and evacuation passages read'),
 dated_source('src-adamist-handbook-mechanoids','The Confederation Handbook: developed Adamist consumer machinery','Peter F. Hamilton','https://www.everand.com/book/492024362/The-Confederation-Handbook','Indexed handbook passage: early colony servitor animals give way to consumer mechanoids/cybernetics once a developed economy exists; religious and local bitek exceptions vary.','Bounded primary passage, not a full handbook read or one uniform welfare law for all Adamist worlds.',kind='primary_text',access='Indexed colony-development and mundane-task mechanization paragraphs read'),
 dated_source('src-ocisen-official-armada','The Evolutionary Void: Ocisen armada','Peter F. Hamilton / Penguin Random House','https://prhinternationalsales.com/book/?isbn=9780345496584','Official excerpt identifies the approaching Ocisen Empire armada, associated Prime ship problems and military planning concerned with life on both sides.','Military excerpt, not a civilian rights charter or proof that each vessel/Prime body is a separate conscious person.',kind='primary_text',access='Indexed official armada and deterrence-fleet passage read'),
]
