(-.25,.02,.45),([-.95,.9],[-1,.4],[.03,.95]),('Actual manufactured habitat supports a floor, with entitlement uncertain.','Sentient provider concentration is analogical; biological or machine origin is not settled.','Human useful roles remain; ship scale and domes do not determine participation.'),
