write_revision(39,changes,'Twelve Reynolds/Hamilton material orders retained from fourteen old holds. Fountainhead trade and Adamist routine-task mechanization gain bounded corroboration; High Angel/Tranquillity provider identity is not assumed machine, and advanced aliens do real work. Troika’s wrong discovery label and Greenfly ecology receive completed comparisons.')
